      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- TryScent &#8212; Social proof (herr) &#8212; Custom Liquid paste block.\n     8 recensioner fr&#229;n manliga kunder p&#229; Trustpilot (se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co),\n     h&#228;mtade 20.08.2026. Teman: doftkvalitet, likhet med originalet, h&#229;llbarhet.\n     Citat verbatim; endast emoji borttagna och interpunktion normaliserad.\n     Ren HTML+CSS, scoped till .ts-proof-sv. Inga Liquid-taggar. -->\n\n<style>\n  .ts-proof-sv{\n    --green:#14843d;\n    --green-dark:#0f6b31;\n    --green-soft:#eaf6ee;\n    --ink:#111315;\n    --muted:#626b74;\n    --line:#e6e8e8;\n    --star:#ffb000;\n    font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7f8f6);\n    padding:76px 0 53px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\n  .ts-proof-sv .container{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 36px));margin-inline:auto}\n  .ts-proof-sv .proof-head{text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 15px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .kicker{\n    font-size:13px;\n    letter-spacing:.13em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    font-weight:800;\n    color:var(--green);\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .section-title{\n    font-size:clamp(26px,3.3vw,43px);\n    line-height:1.02;\n    letter-spacing:-.045em;\n    margin-bottom:12px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    gap:22px;\n    overflow-x:auto;\n    scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n    scrollbar-width:none;\n    padding:8px 4px 22px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card{\n    flex:0 0 calc(33.333% - 15px);\n    min-width:330px;\n    scroll-snap-align:start;\n    background:#fff;\n    border:1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius:20px;\n    padding:26px 26px 13px;\n    box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(16,34,22,.06);\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-top{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    gap:14px;\n    margin-bottom:11px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-stars{color:var(--star);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:19px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified:hover{text-decoration:underline}\n  .ts-proof-sv .tp-dot{color:var(--green)}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card h3{\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.22;\n    letter-spacing:-.035em;\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p{\n    color:var(--muted);\n    line-height:1.62;\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p.result-line{\n    margin:8px 0 12px;\n    padding:15px 16px;\n    border-radius:14px;\n    background:var(--green-soft);\n    color:var(--green-dark);\n    font-weight:800;\n    font-size:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .person{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person strong{display:block;font-size:14px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35;display:block}\n  @media (max-width:1024px){\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{flex-basis:48%}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:700px){\n    .ts-proof-sv{padding:30px 0 21px}\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{min-width:86%;flex-basis:86%}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"ts-proof-sv\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"proof-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">D&#228;rf&#246;r stannade de kvar hos TryScent</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">De s&#228;ger det b&#228;ttre &#228;n vi n&#229;gonsin skulle kunna.</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"carousel\">\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Det b&#228;sta &#228;r att de h&#229;ller otroligt l&#228;nge &#8211; b&#229;de p&#229; huden och i kl&#228;derna.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Riktigt bra kvalitet f&#246;r pengarna. Parfymerna doftar exklusivt. Perfekt om man vill ha lyxiga, djupa dofter utan att betala &#246;verpris. Smidig hemsida och bra upplevelse &#246;verlag. Rekommenderas starkt!</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Sitter kvar p&#229; huden. Och i kl&#228;derna.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Hassan Alzoubi</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;H&#229;ller v&#228;ldigt l&#228;nge, upp till 24h om inte mer.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Tog ett par dagar att f&#229; hem varorna. Hade best&#228;llt 6 olika parfymer. Samtliga parfymer luktar v&#228;ldigt lika originalet. Rekommenderas f&#246;r den sparsamme.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Ett dygn p&#229; huden.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Abdish Milli</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;H&#229;ller b&#228;ttre &#228;n originalet.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Alla dofter luktar exakt som originalet.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Daniel</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Parfymerna h&#229;ller l&#228;nge och v&#228;ldigt identiska.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Fick min f&#246;rsta best&#228;llning som var 6 olika parfymer, nu har jag best&#228;llt 8 stycken och ser fram emot n&#228;r dem kommer.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Sex flaskor f&#246;rst. Sedan &#229;tta till.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Samer Najmadin</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Lukterna &#228;r underbara, sitter hela dagen l&#229;ng.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Riktigt smidigt k&#246;p och bra hemsida.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Fredrik Karlsson</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Till en b&#246;rjan var jag skeptisk &#8230;&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Men n&#228;r jag gjorde min f&#246;rsta best&#228;llning uppt&#228;ckte jag att parfymerna &#228;r fantastiska och mycket lika originalparfymerna. Dessutom &#228;r priset verkligen riktigt bra. Jag kommer definitivt att forts&#228;tta handla fr&#229;n TryScent i framtiden.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Skeptisk innan. Stamkund nu.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Ahmad Ismail</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Det &#228;r ju inte m&#228;rket som doftar, det &#228;r ju inneh&#229;llet.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Dofterna s&#229; lika original, fast till priset av en br&#229;kdel av vad originalet kostar.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Kristian Ljunggren</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Kvaliteten &#246;vertr&#228;ffade mina f&#246;rv&#228;ntningar.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Jag best&#228;llde tv&#229; parfymer och jag &#228;r verkligen imponerad. Dofterna &#228;r mycket lika originalen. Dessutom var servicen snabb och professionell. Jag &#228;r v&#228;ldigt n&#246;jd med mitt k&#246;p och kan varmt rekommendera er till andra.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Amran Timimi</strong><span>Verifierad recensent p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
